{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107918","id":2613057289,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6bwBcJ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107918","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107918.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107918.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107918","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107918/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107918/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107918/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ed5a9860a6468157d374cc171b5621bd591a374e","number":107918,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix custom Text Editor theme changes on reload","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103914\r\n\r\nWhen the EditorSettings loads defaults, I replaced the call to `_load_godot2_text_editor_theme` with `EDITOR_SETTING*`, this is so the text editor theme settings always saves to the editor settings file, just like the editor theme settings does. This is important when loading and the preset is Custom.\r\nThe `_load_godot2_text_editor_theme` should probably be moved to the editor theme manager in the future, for now I left it as is since the text editor theme loading still uses it.\r\n\r\nI wanted to have the EditorSettingsDialog immediately update so the revert icons show, but I ran into an issue with the ColorPickerButton completely freezing the dialog if it was open while reloading. As before, they only reload when reopening the category or the dialog. It shouldn't cause any issues that they aren't immediately updated, since it is just for the revert buttons.\r\n\r\nThe initial values for the Custom preset are now the current Default theme. So if you were on Godot 2 and change to Custom, all of the values can be reverted, and the same from Default if the editor's base color changes, since Default changes based on it.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22